sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant R as Redis Stream
    participant W as Verifier Worker
    participant S as Supabase Storage
    participant AI as AI Services
    participant D as Domain Database
    participant M as Media Verifier

    R-->>W: Read message from post_creation_stream
    W->>W: Validate payload and deduplicate
    W->>S: Verify user-scoped media objects
    alt Invalid or malicious media
        W->>D: Record rejected result
        W->>R: ACK / dead-letter
    else Valid submission
        W->>AI: Analyze text, topic, embeddings, DQS
        AI-->>W: Analysis result
        W->>D: Insert post and media as pending
        W->>R: ACK
        W->>M: Enqueue media verification
        M-->>D: Mark media/post active or rejected
    end

    Note over W,D: Current repository has the database client scaffold only.
